# Only here because the Docker build context may turn out to be the repository
# root: Render has resolved COPY against it even with `dockerContext` naming
# jarvis-mobile/. The Dockerfile copes with either, and this keeps the larger
# of the two from dragging along things the image never installs.
.git/
.github/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/

# Built with Gradle, never inside the image.
jarvis-mobile/android/

# Notes and skills, not application code.
.claude/
mapa-mental-tasko/
Checkpoint.md
